  "description": "Migrate records between Microsoft Dataverse / Dynamics 365 environments while preserving the record GUID. A record that is missing on the target is created with the same Id; a record whose Id already exists is updated. Optional ownership migration, status migration via SetState, and N:N association replication. An XrmToolBox tool.",
